    <mxCell id="gw" value="api-gateway :8088&#10;Spring Cloud Gateway 3.5.5 · WebFlux&#10;REST routes /api/* — JWT + API-key filter&#10;GraphQL BFF — POST /graphql (aggregation)&#10;Rate limiter (Redis token bucket) · circuit breakers&#10;Aggregated Swagger (4 groups) · X-Correlation-ID" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
